{"seq":44,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28406"},"reason":"New question added to grow the article from five to six facts: According to Genesis, how many people survived the Flood in Noah's ark? (answer: 8 people), verified against the cited sources.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1+Peter+3%3A20%3BGenesis+7%3A13&version=NRSVUE"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genesis_flood_narrative"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"8 people"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"8 Menschen"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"8 человек"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2292,8],"de":[2505,10],"ru":[2325,9]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"80","end":null,"precision":"year","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The First Letter of Peter counts the „eight persons“ saved in the ark","labelDe":"Der erste Petrusbrief zählt die „acht Seelen“, die in der Arche gerettet wurden","labelRu":"Первое послание Петра называет «восемь душ», спасшихся в ковчеге"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=1+Peter+3%3A20%3BGenesis+7%3A13&version=NRSVUE","title":"1 Peter 3:20; Genesis 7:13 (NRSVUE) – Bible Gateway","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"886311ca3381"},
